Section: 1. Introduction
Text: We present preliminary experimental results on two text corpora (including a cor- pus of clinical notes), showing that anchors can be used to discover topics that are more speciﬁc and relevant. What is more, we demonstrate the potential for this framework to perform weakly supervised learning in settings where labeling documents is prohibitively expensive (Chen et al., 2013; Agarwal et al., 2016). With respect to interpretable machine learning, our con- tributions are twofold.

